OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 9 APR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gershwin
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod tells the story of
OL,6,     GGeorge Gershwin's first
OL,7,     Gexperience of working in
OL,8,     GHollywood.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GPianist Edward Leung performs
OL,11,     Glive in the studio and we talk to
OL,12,     GMark Ravenhill on directing a new
OL,13,     Gproduction of Salome by Regents
OL,14,     GOpera.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,18,     Gfavourites, including music by
OL,19,     GElgar, Schubert and Ravel.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
