OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 9 APR
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GSoweto shares more exciting new
OL,6,     Gjazz selections including a track
OL,7,     Gfrom the leading British jazz,
OL,8,     Greggae and soul singer Julie
OL,9,     GDexter, and Allexa Nava presents
OL,10,     Ganother Flowers pick.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GThe pianist Alexandre Kantorow
OL,13,     Gperforms Liszt's second piano
OL,14,     Gconcerto. Joined by the WDR
OL,15,     GSymphony Orchestra, who perform
OL,16,     GSchumann's Rhenish Symphony and
OL,17,     GWagner's Faust Overture.
